# Note: generated Go source (e.g. from `codegen`) is intentionally not blanket-ignored here — if
# this repo ever commits generated code, it should be committed on purpose, not silently dropped.
# See ../csvx-go's .gitignore for why: a fresh clone must be able to `go build` without consumers
# running codegen themselves.

# Local CSVX packages and inspection output
*.csvx

